# Power BI writes TMDL and PBIR with CRLF on Windows. Normalise to LF in the repository so a
# Desktop save does not show up as "every line changed", and so the files stay byte-stable
# across machines. Power BI reads either line ending; what it will NOT accept is a UTF-8 BOM,
# so never configure an editor or script to add one to these files.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.xlsx binary
*.pbix binary
*.pbit binary
*.abf binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
